  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Collections Schema</h1>

  <p class="text-lg mb-6">This page documents the schema for the <a href="/cms/data/libraryCollections.json" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">/cms/data/libraryCollections.json</a> endpoint.</p>

  <section class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Overview</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">The collections metadata describes thematic groupings of books within the library catalog.</p>

    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Key Fields</h3>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
      <li><code class="bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1 rounded">name</code> - Collection name</li>
      <li><code class="bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1 rounded">slug</code> - URL-safe collection identifier</li>
      <li><code class="bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1 rounded">description</code> - Collection description</li>
      <li><code class="bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1 rounded">count</code> - Number of books in collection</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="mt-4">Collections represent curatorial groupings such as "Ephemera", "Photography", "Magazines", and subject-specific thematic collections.</p>
  </section>

